p_body:
I have tried making a C++ modules version for FTXUI, using modules `ftxui.*`, which is built if CMake version is above 3.28. I've tested these modules on my own projects and they work fine, and I'm sure most C++20+ users would like the ability to import FTXUI as a module.

FTXUI is now importable with:
```cpp
import ftxui; // Imports all of the submodules

// Alternatively, each submodule can be imported individually
import ftxui.component;
import ftxui.dom;
import ftxui.screen;
import ftxui.util;
```

